    description: 'Free lease renewal letter template: offer a tenant a new fixed term or month-to-month extension with updated rent and terms.',
    lead: 'A letter from a landlord to a tenant offering to renew their lease for a new fixed term (often 12 months) or on a month-to-month basis, with any updated terms and rent.',
    introParagraphs: ['A lease renewal letter is sent to a tenant toward the end of their fixed-term lease offering to extend the tenancy. It states the new term, any rent change, and any updated rules or clauses.', 'If the tenant signs and returns the renewal (or a new lease is executed), the tenancy continues under the new terms. If the tenant declines or does not respond by the deadline, the lease typically rolls to month-to-month per local law or ends as written.'],
