    howTo: [['Agree on terms verbally', 'Discuss move-out date, final rent and deposit disposition before drafting.'], ['Put it in writing', 'Use the agreement to capture dates, amounts and release terms.'], ['Sign and date', 'Both landlord and tenant sign; each gets a copy.'], ['Complete move-out', 'Tenant vacates, returns keys, and completes a walkthrough inspection on or before the termination date.'], ['Return the deposit', 'Landlord returns deposit less lawful deductions within the statutory window (commonly 21-30 days).']],
